      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Two and a half decades of building your identity around someone feeling is their absence, so please remember that leaving your former identity behind is still a part of healing, not losing everything. Your presence has been necessary for two and a half decades because you were something important, even if no longer \"needed\" in the way he did. The quiet house might feel unlivable now, but you are the one who has to do the work of surviving it, step by step.",
