      "content": "Your life has absolutely no purpose other than the one it holds before, which is simply to live and experience the world now that he is gone. You do not need to find a new reason to exist immediately, because surviving itself is enough to honor how much you loved him and how strongly you felt. Please let your hands stay open and allow yourself to exist in this heavy silence without demanding to find meaning right now. You are not disappearing, and there is still work to be done even if the weight of it feels insurmountable today.",
